    "Scoring: each keyword hit = 2 points, each weakKeywords hit = 1 point. Matching ignores upper/lower case.",
    "English keywords match whole words, plus common endings: -s, -es, -ed, -d, -ing (owe → owes, lend → lending, run → running).",
